    "alt": "Poster, The Slow Erosion of the Public. The flag-patterned Host, collared by government, feeds from a trough labeled status, fear, addiction, while a two-headed leech draws on labor, time, attention, data, savings, taxes, and debt. Its old head is labeled Security–Industrial and its new head Technological–Platform. To the right, people work together under a sign reading Parallel Systems. The poster reads: Parallel systems are the only way out. 4Us, Economy for Us. Join the movement."
  },
